Copyright (c) 2026 Nathan Riddick

The design of this package derives from citor by Vitalii Shutov
(https://github.com/Lallapallooza/citor, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026
Vitalii Shutov): the per-worker Chase-Lev deques with the last child run
inline, the hot-victim hint, the same-cluster steal bias with a cross-cluster
escape probe, the single-participant inline path and the chain wake. The
deque follows Lê, Pop, Cohen and Nardelli, "Correct and Efficient
Work-Stealing for Weak Memory Models" (PPoPP 2013).

